          "step_number": 1
        },
        {
          "content": "At main_flow step 3, the J3.1 Emergency Point Report is transmitted without an alert because alerts are not used for the J3.1 Emergency Point message since these points cannot be filtered.",
          "evidence_refs": [
            "EC-EF-018"
          ],
          "step_number": 2
        },
        {
          "content": "At main_flow step 4, Force Tell and Emergency Indicators set in J3 messages override all operator-controllable data filters.",
          "evidence_refs": [
            "EC-EF-010"
          ],
          "step_number": 3
        },
        {
          "content": "At main_flow step 4, a system with limited track capacity (e.g., F-15) should manage its database to ensure that it is not saturated by force tell and emergency alerts.",
